        && mlb_mark($tag, "isn't it?")['ok'] && mlb_mark($tag, 'isn’t it')['ok'] && mlb_answer_text($sp) === 'necessary');

    // The map: six stages of ten, EN-001…EN-060; bands cover every stage once; edges stay inside the Lab and point back.
